@startuml
title ATM Control - Validate PIN and Withdraw Funds

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Withdrawal Options" as WithdrawalOptions
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state "Inputting Amount" as InputtingAmount
state "Cancelling Transaction" as CancellingTransaction
state DispensingCash
state PrintingReceipt
state ReturningCard
state RunningOutOfCash
state Resetting

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WithdrawalOptions : Correct PIN / Show Options

WithdrawalOptions --> InputtingAmount : User Chooses Amount / Get Amount
InputtingAmount --> Confiscating : Too Many Incorrect Entries / Card Confiscated
InputtingAmount --> CancellingTransaction : User Cancels / Return Card
InputtingAmount --> DispensingCash : Approved Transaction / Dispense Cash
InputtingAmount --> PrintingReceipt : Approved Transaction / Print Receipt
InputtingAmount --> RunningOutOfCash : No More Cash / Running Out of Cash
InputtingAmount --> Resetting : Completed Session / Reset ATM

CancellingTransaction --> ReturningCard : User Cancels / Return Card

DispensingCash --> ReturningCard : Transaction Completed / Return Card
PrintingReceipt --> ReturningCard : Receipt Printed / Return Card
RunningOutOfCash --> Resetting : No More Cash / Reset ATM
@enduml
